  "description": "Synthetic electric hydraulic supply with a sampled pressure PI regulator. The controller reads actual line pressure every 5 ms, owns the motor voltage channel, limits voltage to 0..12 V and conditionally integrates to prevent windup. Exact-tick pressure setpoint and clutch valve events exercise held commands, fill/drain disturbances and recovery. RL motor, pump leakage/drag, hydraulic storage and clutch heat share the conserving solve. Constant research parameters are unverified; no battery, sensor delay/filter, PWM/current loop, complete ECU/TCU or OEM calibration.",
